    "Your provider changes this site's DNS answers. While the bypass is on, Zapret looks names up with encrypted DNS (DNS over HTTPS), which gets around this." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Operatörünüz bu sitenin DNS yanıtlarını değiştiriyor. Engel aşma açıkken Zapret adları şifreli DNS (DNS over HTTPS) ile sorgular, bu da engeli aşar."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Anbieter verfälscht die DNS-Antworten für diese Website. Bei eingeschalteter Umgehung löst Zapret Namen über verschlüsseltes DNS (DNS over HTTPS) auf und umgeht das."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu proveedor altera las respuestas DNS de este sitio. Con el desbloqueo activado, Zapret resuelve los nombres con DNS cifrado (DNS sobre HTTPS), que evita este bloqueo."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il tuo provider altera le risposte DNS di questo sito. Con il bypass attivo, Zapret risolve i nomi con il DNS cifrato (DNS over HTTPS), che aggira il problema."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre fournisseur d’accès modifie les réponses DNS de ce site. Tant que le contournement est activé, Zapret résout les noms avec un DNS chiffré (DNS over HTTPS), ce qui contourne ce blocage."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sua operadora altera as respostas de DNS deste site. Com o desbloqueio ligado, o Zapret consulta os nomes com DNS criptografado (DNS sobre HTTPS), o que contorna isso."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Провайдер подменяет DNS-ответы для этого сайта. Пока обход включён, Zapret узнаёт адреса через зашифрованный DNS (DNS over HTTPS), и подмена не мешает."
          }
        }
      }
